---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import '../../styles/guest-pages.css';

const infos = await getCollection('infos');

// 手動添加獨立的 .astro 頁面
const standalonePages = [
  { id: 'guide', data: { title: '交通指引', order: 2 } },
  { id: 'set-menu-info', data: { title: '代訂合菜', order: 6 } },
];

// 合併 content collection 和獨立頁面
const allInfos = [...infos.map(info => ({ id: info.id.replace('.md', ''), data: info.data })), ...standalonePages];
const sortedInfos = allInfos.sort((a, b) => (a.data.order ?? 99) - (b.data.order ?? 99));
---

<BaseLayout
  title="關於密式"
  description="認識苗栗泰安密式旅行的營區、小木屋、桌遊咖啡廳與兒童遊戲室，並查閱交通指引、訂房匯款、園內規約、菜單及園區地圖。"
  keywords="關於密式,密式旅行故事,苗栗露營區"
  preloadImage="/images/landing_banner.webp"
>
  <main id="main" class="about-page">
  <section id="banner" class="style2" style="background-image: url('/images/landing_banner.webp');">
    <div class="inner">
      <header class="major">
        <h1>關於密式</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="info-nav-container">
        <div class="info-nav">
          {sortedInfos.map((info, index) => (
            <a href={`/infos/${info.id}/`} class="info-link">
              <span class="directory-number" aria-hidden="true" data-number={String(index + 1).padStart(2,'0')}></span>
              <span>{info.data.title}</span>
              <span class="directory-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


    <div class="inner">
      <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: '關於密式' }]} />
    </div>

    <section id="two" class="spotlights">
      <section>
        <span class="image">
          <img src="/images/landing/landing_img_1.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="密式小木屋外觀與泰安山景" width="640" height="480" />
        </span>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="inner">
            <header class="major">
              <h2>密式小木屋</h2>
            </header>
            <p>入住密式小木屋，在房內眺出就可以將泰安山景盡收眼底，靜下心來看本書，淨空您的思想，等您發現時，夕陽已經染紅了整片山頭。曠野徐徐微風，小溪水聲潺潺，蟲鳴鳥叫蛙鳴，銀河流星月亮，自然彷彿就在你耳邊低語。</p>
            <p class="yellow">※ 木屋禁止攜帶寵物</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="image">
          <img src="/images/landing/landing_img_2.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="密式露營區營地景觀" width="640" height="480" />
        </span>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="inner">
            <header class="major">
              <h2>密式露營區</h2>
            </header>
            <p>密式露營區，採小包區形式，地形落差大，平望出去即可看清整座山，三面環山彷彿置身山林中心，每到夕陽西下之時，夕陽的餘暉灑滿了整片山頭，抹紅一片山嵐，暖紅色的光芒慢慢地跟著它爬到遠處，直到它沒入遠方的山頭。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="image">
          <img src="/images/landing/landing_img_3.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="密式桌遊咖啡廳內部環境" width="640" height="480" />
        </span>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="inner">
            <header class="major">
              <h2>密式桌遊咖啡廳</h2>
            </header>
            <p>密式咖啡廳，提供上百種桌遊給旅客遊玩，並且在現場提供桌遊教學服務。即使不玩遊戲，在夕陽西下的時候點杯咖啡，靜靜的享受夜幕的降臨也是別有一番風味。</p>
            <p class="yellow">適合年齡：5 歲以上</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="image">
          <img src="/images/landing/landing_img_4.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="密式遊戲室" width="640" height="480" />
        </span>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="inner">
            <header class="major">
              <h2>密式遊戲室</h2>
            </header>
            <p>密式遊戲室提供多種兒童玩具，並且開放旅客免費遊玩，遊戲室由木頭建成，室內開放冷氣，即使天氣不佳小朋友也不怕沒地方去。</p>
            <p class="yellow">適合年齡：8 歲以下</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="image">
          <img src="/images/landing/landing_img_5.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="密式多肉小舖" width="640" height="480" />
        </span>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="inner">
            <header class="major">
              <h2>密式多肉小舖</h2>
            </header>
            <p>園區除了大量植栽外，處處也可見用多肉植物打造出的指尖綠意。</p>
            <p>除了提供植栽現場販售，也可客訂組盆，另有 DIY 組盆教學，如有興趣可洽營主。</p>
            <p class="yellow">適合年齡：8 歲以上</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="image">
          <img src="/images/landing/landing_img_6.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="密式沙坑" width="640" height="480" />
        </span>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="inner">
            <header class="major">
              <h2>密式沙坑</h2>
            </header>
            <p>密式沙坑由木頭建成，在裡頭填滿了白沙，提供到訪的小小朋友一個戶外的放電場所。</p>
            <p class="yellow">適合年齡：5 歲以下</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="image">
          <img src="/images/landing/landing_img_7.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="密式植栽區" width="640" height="480" />
        </span>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="inner">
            <header class="major">
              <h2>密式植栽</h2>
            </header>
            <p>密式園區內栽種大量植栽、季節水果</p>
            <p>來到密式的旅客可以摘取成熟的果實就地享用，享受季節及自然的饋贈</p>
            <p class="yellow">※ 採摘的水果、作物禁止外帶</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="image">
          <img src="/images/landing/landing_img_8.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="密式書櫃" width="640" height="480" />
        </span>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="inner">
            <header class="major">
              <h2>密式書櫃</h2>
            </header>
            <p>密式書櫃由老板的少年時代所組成，飽含了老板少年時期的回憶</p>
            <p>在這裡可以品味一下來自九零年代的少年情懷</p>
            <p class="yellow">適合年齡：6 歲以上</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>

#main.about-page { background:var(--color-bg); padding-bottom:4rem; }
#banner { position:relative; padding:8rem 0 3rem; background-size:cover; background-position:center; }
#banner::before { content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(36,41,67,.88),rgba(36,41,67,.42)); }
#banner > .inner { position:relative; z-index:1; }
.inner { width:min(100% - 3rem,72rem); margin-inline:auto; }
#banner h1 { margin:0 0 2.5rem; font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.8rem); }
.info-nav { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.75rem; }
.info-link { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto; align-items:center; gap:.75rem; min-height:76px; padding:1rem; border:1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius:.6rem; background:var(--color-surface); color:var(--color-paper); font-size:1rem; }
.info-link:hover,.info-link:focus-visible { border-color:var(--color-aqua); color:var(--color-aqua); }
.directory-number { color:var(--color-champagne); font-size:.85rem; }
.directory-arrow { color:var(--color-aqua); }
.directory-number::before { content:attr(data-number); }
.directory-arrow::before { content:'↗'; }
.spotlights { width:min(100% - 3rem,72rem); margin:2.5rem auto 0; display:grid; gap:2rem; }
.spotlights > section { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; border:1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius:1rem; overflow:hidden; background:var(--color-surface); }
.spotlights > section:nth-child(even) .image { order:2; }
.spotlights .image { display:block; min-height:320px; }
.spotlights .image img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; }
.spotlights .content { padding:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.75rem); align-self:center; }
.spotlights .content .inner { width:100%; }
.spotlights h2 { font-size:1.6rem; margin:0 0 1.2rem; }
.spotlights p { line-height:1.9; color:var(--color-paper-muted); }
.spotlights .yellow { color:var(--color-champagne); border-left:2px solid var(--color-champagne); padding-left:1rem; margin-bottom:0; }
@media(max-width:1023px) { .info-nav { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } }
@media(max-width:640px) { .inner,.spotlights { width:calc(100% - 2rem); } #banner { padding:6.5rem 0 2rem; } .info-link { grid-template-columns:1fr auto; min-height:70px; } .directory-number { display:none; } .spotlights > section { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .spotlights > section:nth-child(even) .image { order:0; } .spotlights .image { min-height:0; aspect-ratio:4/3; } .spotlights { gap:1.5rem; } }
</style>
